<NAME>Reference requirement</NAME>
<CONTENT>In Attachment 3, under “D. Client Relations and Reference,” question 2 states: “Provide a list of up to 10 current public fund clients with assets greater than $1 billion for whom work similar to that requested in this RFP has been performed by your firm.”

So, the questionnaire requires:
- Current public fund client references to be listed: up to 10
- Minimum asset size for those clients: greater than $1 billion

The same item also asks that each reference include the client’s name, contact, telephone number, asset values, number of years the client has retained the firm, and the product or service used.</CONTENT>
