# Briefing

## Answer
The SBCERS 2020 RFP requires that the proposing firm **must have been in business for at least five (5) years**.

## Supporting Evidence
Section I.F, **“Minimum Qualifications for Proposal,”** states:

- **“The firm must have been in business at least five (5) years providing services similar to those described in the Scope of Services section.”**
- A related requirement also states the organization must have been providing **private equity investment management services for five or more years**.

## Conclusion
**Minimum required time in business: five (5) years.**
</SUMMARY>
