<NAME>INPRS audit term limit.</NAME>
<CONTENT>According to Section 1.3.2, “RSM has provided external audit services to INPRS since 2014.” The same section states that “INPRS’s procurement policy in the INPRS Board Governance Manual limits the contract length to 10 years and requires solicitation of new bids a maximum of every 10 years.”

Related contract language in Section 4.1 is consistent with that policy: the RFP provides for an initial five-year term, with one or more renewals at INPRS’s option, but the total contract period may not exceed ten years.</CONTENT>
