- **Section 3.2(a):** Sets the **minimum annual deferral** at **$260**
- **Section 4.1:** Requires deferrals to be invested **no later than two (2) business days following receipt**, based on the participant’s investment directions

### Conclusion
The Model Plan requires a **minimum deferral of $260 for any plan year**, and participant deferrals must be invested **within 2 business days of receipt**.

