<NAME>Temple City 457 snapshot.</NAME>
<CONTENT>According to the City of Temple City’s 457 Deferred Compensation Plan administration and recordkeeping RFP, as of March 31, 2020, the plan had a total of 46 participants with a balance and total assets of $1,894,729.

The RFP further breaks this out by current provider:
- CalPERS: 23 total participant accounts and $1,525,393 in assets
- ICMA-RC: 23 total participant accounts and $369,336 in assets

The document also notes that there were 31 actively contributing participants and 15 non-active participants, which together equal the 46 participants with balances.</CONTENT>
