<CONTENT>According to the Monroe County Deferred Compensation Plan RFP, as of December 31, 2022, the main plan had 4,398 participants and total plan assets of $308,676,730.

The same section also separately notes an OBRA part-time seasonal component with 536 participants and $926,785 in assets, but the main deferred compensation plan itself is listed at 4,398 participants and $308,676,730.</CONTENT>
