<NAME>ILPA DDQ v1.1 changes.</NAME>
<CONTENT>In the ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire v1.2, version 1.1 is stated to have been released in September 2016.

The document says version 1.1 introduced the following changes:
1. Added new questions regarding compliance with the ILPA Reporting Template, which had been released in January 2016. These additions were made to the “Accounting / Valuation / Reporting” sections.
2. Revised the original “Governance” and “Risk / Compliance / ESG” sections to reflect PRI’s new LP Responsible Investment DDQ. This revision also included re-ordering, merging, and editing existing questions from those sections.
3. Refreshed existing web links, as well as font and formatting, where needed.</CONTENT>
