# Markdown Briefing: ILPA DDQ v1.1 Changes

## Release Date
- **Version 1.1** of the **ILPA Due Diligence Questionnaire** was released in **September 2016**.

## Key Changes Introduced in v1.1
- **Added reporting-template compliance questions**
  - New questions were added to the **Accounting / Valuation / Reporting** sections.
  - These addressed compliance with the **ILPA Reporting Template**, released in **January 2016**.

- **Revised Governance and Risk/Compliance/ESG sections**
  - The **Governance** and **Risk / Compliance / ESG** sections were updated to align with **PRI’s new LP Responsible Investment DDQ**.
  - This included **re-ordering, merging, and editing** existing questions.

- **Refreshed document presentation**
  - Updated **web links**.
  - Refreshed **font and formatting** where needed.

## Bottom Line
- **v1.1 (September 2016)** primarily updated the DDQ to reflect new **ILPA reporting standards**, align with **PRI responsible investment due diligence practices**, and improve **document usability and presentation**.

</SUMMARY>
