  2. Santa Barbara County Employees’ Retirement System Global Custody and Related Services — used as acceptable certification/evidence of security assurance.
  3. INREV Due Diligence Questionnaire for Non-Listed Real Estate Investment Vehicles — used as a due diligence question about compliance/certification.
