<CONTENT>In the Anchorage Police and Fire Retirement System 2025 investment consultant RFP, the minimum amount of assets under management a firm must have is **$2 billion**.

This requirement appears in **Section 3: Information Required from All Proposal Submitters**, under **A. Minimum Consultant Requirements**, which states:

1. **“The firm must have at least $2 Billion under management.”**

This is presented as a minimum qualification for consultants submitting a proposal.</CONTENT>
