<NAME>SBCERA portfolio size</NAME>
<CONTENT>In the Background section of the San Bernardino County Employees’ Retirement Association (SBCERA) Investment Consulting Services RFP, SBCERA states that its investment portfolio is “approximately $12.0 billion in assets.”

Relevant context from the RFP:
- SBCERA was established in 1945.
- It serves nearly 42,000 members and beneficiaries.
- The investment portfolio is described as globally diversified across all asset classes.
- The Plan invests through external investment managers and also uses certain master account structures and an overlay manager.

So, the approximate size of SBCERA’s investment portfolio is $12 billion.</CONTENT>
