[role=assistant] <DESCRIPTION>The provided evidence directly answers the question using the OPERS Investment Consulting Services RFP issued February 18, 2022. It states that proposals had to be received by 4:30 p.m. Central Time on March 25, 2022.</DESCRIPTION>
<NAME>OPERS deadline found.</NAME>
<CONTENT>In the Oklahoma Public Employees Retirement System (OPERS) Request for Proposal #515-22-200 for Investment Consulting Services, the proposal submission deadline is listed as <b>4:30 p.m. Central Time on March 25, 2022</b>.

Relevant evidence from the RFP includes:
- On the Proposal Cover Sheet: “Proposal Deadline must be received by 4:30 pm CT March 25, 2022.”
- In Section II.B, Mandatory Requirements for Submitting a Proposal: “The deadline for receipt of proposals is 4:30 p.m. Central Time, on March 25, 2022.”
- In Section VI, Timeline: “Proposals due (no later than 4:30 p.m. Central Time) March 25, 2022.”

So the proposal submission deadline was <b>March 25, 2022 at 4:30 p.m. CT</b>.</CONTENT>
[role=assistant] <SUMMARY>
# Markdown Briefing

## Proposal Submission Deadline

For the **Oklahoma Public Employees Retirement System (OPERS) Request for Proposal #515-22-200** for **Investment Consulting Services**, the proposal submission deadline was:

- **March 25, 2022**
- **4:30 p.m. Central Time (CT)**

## Supporting Evidence

The RFP states this deadline in multiple places:

- **Proposal Cover Sheet**: “Proposal Deadline must be received by **4:30 pm CT March 25, 2022**.”
- **Section II.B – Mandatory Requirements for Submitting a Proposal**: “The deadline for receipt of proposals is **4:30 p.m. Central Time, on March 25, 2022**.”
- **Section VI – Timeline**: “Proposals due (**no later than 4:30 p.m. Central Time**) **March 25, 2022**.”

## Conclusion

The proposal submission deadline was **March 25, 2022 at 4:30 p.m. CT**.
</SUMMARY>
