<CONTENT>In the Boston Retirement System 2022 investment consulting services RFP, proposers must submit seven (7) complete printed copies of the proposal. The RFP also requires one (1) electronic version.

Relevant language in the RFP includes:
- “Prospective Consultants must submit seven (7) complete printed copies of their Proposal, and one electronic version.”
- “Submit seven (7) printed copies of your Proposal in a sealed package and one (1) version electronically.”

So, the required number of printed copies is 7.</CONTENT>
